# expects-red: unit:Dodona.Tests.GateDecisionTests.every_allow_asked_the_tree_or_had_no_gate_deployed
#
# THE CONTROLS. Nothing without a `--ticket` argument passes this line, so the whole
# unreadable-lane family and the unparseable-stdin verdict must survive:
#
# expects-green: m1:the_gate_denies_a_lane_argument_it_cannot_read
# expects-green: m1:the_misconfiguration_refusal_says_it_is_not_the_agents_mistake
